        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kw’umunani mu mwaka ugira kabiri Dariyo ari ku ngoma, ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryaje kuri Zekariya mwene Berekiya, Berekiya mwene Ido, yar’ ūvugishwa n’Imana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
