            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi wa mirongwibiri na kane wo mu kwezi kw’icumi na rimwe, ni kwo kwezi kwitwa Shebati, mu mwaka ugira kabiri Dariyo ari ku ngoma, ijambo ry’ Uhoraho ryaje kuri Zekariya mwene Berekiya, Berekiya mwene Ido, yar’ ūvugishwa n’Imana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 6:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zekariya aravuga, ati Mw ijoro nagize ntya, mbona umuntu agendera kw ifarasi y’akagajo, ahagaze hagati y’ibiti vy’imihadasi vyo mu gasōko; kand’ inyuma yiwe hār’ amafarasi y’utugajo n’ay’ utunyomvyi n’ay’ ibitare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 22:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ndabaza, nti Mugenzi, ibi n’ibiki? Umumarayika twavugana aranyishura, ati Ndakubarira ivy’ ari vyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.1.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 1:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze wa wundi yar’ ahagaze hagati y’imihadasi aravuga, at’ Abo n’abo Uhoraho yatumye kugendagenda mw isi yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bishura umumarayika w’Uhoraho yar’ ahagaze hagati y’imihadasi, bati Tugendagenze mw isi, kandi rāba, isi yose iratekereje, ifise impore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
