          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbaza umumarayika twavugana, nt’ Ivyo n’ibiki? Aranyishura, at’ Ayo ni yo mahembe yasābagije Abayuda n’Abisirayeli n’ab’i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
