            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndamubaza, nt’ Abo bazanywe no gukora iki? Aranyishura, at’ Ayo mahembe ni yo yasābagije Abayuda, ntihāgira n’umwe avyura umutwe; non’ abo bazanywe no kuyaca ivutu, no gutsinda hasi amahembe y’amahanga, yashize hejuru amahembe yayo ngw arwanye igihugu c’i Buyuda, abasābagize.",
